**The front door was unlocked. Why did you climb through the window?**

And if you mess something up while modifying it, don't come crying to me—the software is provided **“AS IS”** without warranties or liability under the license.

🏴‍☠️ **Pirates: please read the license before stealing something you're already allowed to have.**
